ADDITIONAL NOTICE — FINANCIAL RISK

This software places leveraged orders on cryptocurrency exchanges. Leveraged
trading can result in the total loss of deposited funds and, on some venues,
losses exceeding the initial deposit.

This software has NOT been shown to be profitable. As of the last measurement,
nine strategy hypotheses were tested and all nine were rejected; no statistical
edge has been demonstrated. See README.md for the full status.

Nothing in this repository is financial advice. You alone are responsible for
any funds you risk. The authors accept no liability for trading losses, as
stated in the warranty disclaimer above.
